<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja-JP"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1421267401"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1496082164"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Missing"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="HoneyComeBear"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Missing"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:24.960"><div begin="00:12.565" end="02:46.825"><p begin="00:12.565" end="00:20.229" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">永い夜 サイレンの音で 目醒める<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">漫长永夜</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ga i yo ru</span></p><p begin="00:23.619" end="00:28.779" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">夢現つ 憶えている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">半梦半醒 回忆翻涌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me u tsu tsu o bo e te i ru</span></p><p begin="00:29.382" end="00:33.925" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">嘘のように馴染む この部屋<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难以置信般已与这个房间熟稔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u so no yo u ni na ji mu ko no he ya</span></p><p begin="00:35.212" end="00:39.745" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">陽の無い街 雨は静か<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不见天日的街道 雨落静谧无声</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi no na i ma chi a me ha shi zu ka</span></p><p begin="00:40.520" end="00:45.167" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">天鵞絨の川 灯籠流し<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天鹅绒般的河川 灯笼顺流而下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bi ro u do no ka wa to u ro u na ga shi</span></p><p begin="00:46.055" end="00:50.074" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">偽の女神に 造られても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便虚伪的女神创造了这一切</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni se no me ga mi ni tsu ku ra re te mo</span></p><p begin="00:50.602" end="00:53.586" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">わたしは私なの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也依然是我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ha wa ta shi na no</span></p><p begin="00:56.486" end="01:00.659" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">愛してて 輪廻の先で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请给予我爱 在轮回的尽头</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i shi te te ri n ne no sa ki de</span></p><p begin="01:01.439" end="01:06.887" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">君と 君と ひとりきりになりたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想和你 和你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to ki mi to</span></p><p begin="01:07.725" end="01:12.416" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">何度目の 今を抱えよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拥抱不知第几次来临的此刻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n do me no i ma wo ka ka e yo u</span></p><p begin="01:13.105" end="01:17.512" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">泣けなくても 泣けなくても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便欲哭无泪 即便无法哭泣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ke na ku te mo na ke na ku te mo</span></p><p begin="01:41.801" end="01:50.020" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">靄の中 提灯の明かり 辿って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在烟霭之中 沿着那灯笼的光明</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo ya no na ka cho u chi n no a ka ri ta do 't te</span></p><p begin="01:52.965" end="01:58.191" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">遊技場 並ぶピンボール<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">游戏场里 排着长队的弹珠游戏机</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu u gi jo u na ra bu pi n bo o ru</span></p><p begin="01:58.632" end="02:03.373" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">遥か前 君と遊んだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在很久很久以前 曾和你一起玩过</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ru ka ma e ki mi to a so n da</span></p><p begin="02:04.506" end="02:09.148" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">高層ビルは 誰かのエゴ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这些高楼大厦 又是谁的自我满足</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko u so u bi ru ha da re ka no e go</span></p><p begin="02:09.803" end="02:14.511" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">ちらつくネオン 迷い子はどこ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忽明忽灭的霓虹 迷途之人在何处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi ra tsu ku ne o n ma yo i ko ha do ko</span></p><p begin="02:15.382" end="02:19.487" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">思い出さえも 持ち出せない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连回忆都不曾拥有</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo i de sa e mo mo chi da se na i</span></p><p begin="02:19.704" end="02:22.843" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">どうか忘れないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还请你别把我忘记</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u ka wa su re na i de</span></p><p begin="02:25.878" end="02:30.036" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">朱い糸 きつく結んだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">红线牢牢系在一起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ka i i to ki tsu ku mu su n da</span></p><p begin="02:30.859" end="02:36.240" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">君と 君と 離れることできずに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和你 和你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to ki mi to</span></p><p begin="02:37.134" end="02:41.363" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">繰り返し 焦がれ奪われ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">反反复复 期望的一切都被剥夺</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ri ka e shi ko ga re u ba wa re</span></p><p begin="02:42.334" end="02:46.825" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">泣きたいほど 泣きたいほど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">令人不禁潸然泪下 潸然泪下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ki ta i ho do na ki ta i ho do</span></p></div></body></tt>